# Pro DJ Link fixture: keep-alive-virtual-cdj
# Real capture: https://github.com/Deep-Symmetry/dysentery/blob/main/doc/assets/to-virtual.pcapng
#   (to-virtual.pcapng, frame 18; 172.16.42.2:50002 -> 172.16.42.255:50000, UDP payload 0x36 bytes)
# Documented in: https://djl-analysis.deepsymmetry.org/djl-analysis/vcdj.html#creating-vcdj
# Keep-alive of a virtual CDJ (device 5, name 'Virtual CDJ') sent from UDP
# source port 50002, after which the players unicast status to it.
# Bytes: UDP payload, hex, 16 per line.
51 73 70 74 31 57 6d 4a 4f 4c 06 00 56 69 72 74
75 61 6c 20 43 44 4a 00 00 00 00 00 00 00 00 00
01 02 00 36 05 01 3c 15 c2 e7 08 6c ac 10 2a 02
01 00 00 00 01 00
